        "description": "Neonatal hypotonia",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of characteristic cat-like cry and confirmed 5p deletion by genetic testing",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is confirmed by cytogenetic or molecular genetic testing identifying deletion on chromosome 5p."
